{"c":[{"id":"c0b91843eda5c237","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77). fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:. No nested stores: root wake omits catalog how-to; -h documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"edb0ea0fb012e074","sum":"write_nap rejects intersecting digest sets; identical loose notes heal to the later filename (#77)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T223329Z-dff4d96e7ee27dcc","text":"write_nap rejects any intersecting digest sets; two identical loose notes collapse on heal to the later filename (#77)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T230843Z-3ad41bcf17625899","text":"heal-same-text archived to memory-bank/archive/bug-fixes/20260829-heal-same-text.md; PR #79","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ec999124e9bbfbf6","sum":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, and zoom; ids stay on Run:. With no nested stores, root wake omits catalog how-to; -h still documents --path.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T232955Z-ce112a8dc2e0252b","text":"fold_request quotes caption/note text only; grain and date stay on wake, recall, zoom; ids stay on Run:","type":"note"},{"name":"20260903T213935Z-aa0196fbeb246257","text":"Root wake omits catalog how-to when no nested stores exist; operator -h still documents --path.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"34adeab4ac984330","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable, stock stays Unix; do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix). Usage/Run: print host invoke (sys.executable). Lock and CRLF-on-read let a shop patch its bootstrap; no consumer .gitattributes, no store lock file.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"819660f9289867d7","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0; not pasteable). Usage/Run may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; no store lock file. No consumer .gitattributes; canonicalize CRLF on read; punt this-repo git symlink.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T005128Z-e234bb60ff9049ba","text":"Windows: AGENTS.md stays clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0); Usage/Run: may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; do not flock a store lock file.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T010940Z-0a0daf8323fd00b0","text":"Windows port: no consumer .gitattributes — canonicalize CRLF on read for digest/JSON; punt this-repo git symlink; AGENTS.md is not a pasteable argv0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"597efaa40d5ae61b","sum":"Windows: do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix shells); internals (lock, CRLF) let a Windows shop patch its bootstrap. Usage/Run: print the host invoke (sys.executable); stock AGENTS.md stays Unix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T011527Z-a89670306f0346b1","text":"Do not advertise native Windows: no argv0 is a command in both cmd.exe and a Unix shell. Ceiling is internals (lock, CRLF) so a Windows-only shop can patch their bootstrap.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T011559Z-5a487f135c8e6892","text":"Windows: print host-specific invoke on Usage/Run: (sys.executable). Stock AGENTS.md stays Unix; only a shop that patched the bootstrap will see the Windows lines.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
